  "description": "Archies is a compact wooden arch tower from our Nature Sparsh collection, made for two kinds of play at once. A yellow tube slide leaves from one side and a blue open slide from the other, and children climb up by a wooden climbing wall or a ladder. One child can climb while another slides, which keeps a queue moving. The tower suits ages 5 to 12 and takes up to 15 children. It comes in Banana Yellow and Baby Blue. The product area is 24'9\" x 7'5\", with a safe play area of 30'9\" x 10'5\", so it sits neatly along a narrow lawn. Our 3-year warranty covers its galvanised pipes, roto-moulded slides, composite laminates and play rope. Send us the width of your site.",
